Prayer timeouts alone can cause your problem, on some
ridiculously small probability. The gruesome details,
with some commentary that makes things much worse, can
be found here:


http://groups-beta.google.com/group/rec.games.roguelike.nethack/msg/ba910f270c7b5c49?dmode=source

http://groups-beta.google.com/group/rec.games.roguelike.nethack/msg/3d674a6092e0f0d3?dmode=source

Executive summary:

The worst "plain bad luck" prayer timeout can run to
almost 7000 turns; mixed with late game circumstances,
that can extend to over 40,000 turns.

So, if the RNG is out to get you, the only safe prayer
is one made right after a sacrifice's resulting signal
_proves_ it to be safe.

